# Mica Slicer update signing PUBLIC keys (minisign / Ed25519), embedded in every build.
#
# Add the public .pub lines from `cargo packager signer generate` below these comments
# (one base64 line per key). First key line = main key; further lines = backup key(s).
# Any listed key may sign an update. Blank lines and # comment lines are ignored.
# MICA_UPDATE_PUBKEY at build time can override this list (newlines or commas).
# See docs/release.md for creating the main and offline backup keys and rotating them.
# Without keys here or a build override, packaged builds say "this build cannot verify
# updates" and never install anything; `scripts/release.sh` (without --dry-run) refuses to build.
#
# Never put private keys here or anywhere in this repository.
#
# Main key (minisign key ID 38E6549228EFDF5F), then the offline backup key (BD1024C97F66901A).
